  "notes": "USAGE:\nIn Japanese, トレード is primarily associated with sports (player trades) and collecting (card trading). For general commerce, {貿易|ぼうえき} (international trade) or {取引|とりひき} (business transaction) is used instead.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- トレードする: to trade\n- {大型|おおがた}トレード: major trade\n- トレード{期限|きげん}: trade deadline\n- トレーディングカード: trading card\n- トレードマーク: trademark (often figurative: someone's signature characteristic)",
